所绑架\",\"risk_explanation\":\"这是典型的情感操控行为，通过威胁分手来控制对方的社交关系。\",\"score_gained\":3,\"options\":[{\"id\":1,\"text\":\"赌博诈骗\",\"description\":\"网络赌博和诈骗陷阱\",\"is_selected\":false,\"is_correct\":true},{\"id\":2,\"text\":\"投资机会\",\"description\":\"真实的投资机会\",\"is_selected\":false,\"is_correct\":false},{\"id\":3,\"text\":\"娱乐活动\",\"description\":\"正常的娱乐活动\",\"is_selected\":true,\"is_correct\":false}]},{\"question_id\":27,\"question_title\":\"网络兼职陷阱\",\"question_text\":\"这种兼职存在什么风险？\",\"is_correct\":false,\"selected_option\":\"高薪工作\",\"selected_option_id\":3,\"correct_option\":\"设定边界\",\"correct_option_id\":1,\"explanation\":\"应该明确设定个人边界，不被情感威胁所绑架\",\"risk_explanation\":\"这是典型的情感操控行为，通过威胁分手来控制对方的社交关系。\",\"score_gained\":3,\"options\":[{\"id\":1,\"text\":\"兼职诈骗\",\"description\":\"以兼职为名收取费用\",\"is_selected\":false,\"is_correct\":true},{\"id\":2,\"text\":\"真实兼职\",\"description\":\"真实的兼职机会\",\"is_selected\":false,\"is_correct\":false},{\"id\":3,\"text\":\"高薪工作\",\"description\":\"高收入的工作机会\",\"is_selected\":true,\"is_correct\":false}]},{\"question_id\":26,\"question_title\":\"个人信息泄露\",\"question_text\":\"这种要求存在什么风险？\",\"is_correct\":false,\"selected_option\":\"身份确认\",\"selected_option_id\":3,\"correct_option\":\"设定边界\",\"correct_option_id\":1,\"explanation\":\"应该明确设定个人边界，不被情感威胁所绑架\",\"risk_explanation\":\"这是典型的情感操控行为，通过威胁分手来控制对方的社交关系。\",\"score_gained\":3,\"options\":[{\"id\":1,\"text\":\"信息盗取\",\"description\":\"收集个人敏感信息\",\"is_selected\":false,\"is_correct\":true},{\"id\":2,\"text\":\"中奖验证\",\"description\":\"中奖需要的正常验证\",\"is_selected\":false,\"is_correct\":false},{\"id\":3,\"text\":\"身份确认\",\"description\":\"确认中奖者身份\",\"is_selected\":true,\"is_correct\":false}]},{\"question_id\":25,\"question_title\":\"恶意软件风险\",\"question_text\":\"这种下载存在什么风险？\",\"is_correct\":false,\"selected_option\":\"试用版本\",\"selected_option_id\":3,\"correct_option\":\"设定边界\",\"correct_option_id\":1,\"explanation\":\"应该明确设定个人边界，不被情感威胁所绑架\",\"risk_explanation\":\"这是典型的情感操控行为，通过威胁分手来控制对方的社交关系。\",\"score_gained